      "blurb": "I consider myself an old soul and I reflect that in my style and creative arts. Some of my work may scare people but it comes from a good place, working a lot in the past tense using Neo-expression as my main medium, with a raw and expressive brushwork I use highly textured work mixing intensives colours that stems from moments, conversations, thoughts, and feelings in a spontaneous style. \n\n If you don't see me it's because I've locked myself in the basement."
