        ],
      "blurb": "Cami Cupples is a mixed media artist and creative facilitator. \n\n She has traveled from the U.S. and created a self-directed art residency at the Rundle Collective for the year, exploring concepts of sustainability, materiality, and community. She has also worked on film creative direction with the wonderful Zanny Edhouse. \n\n With a degree in architectural design, her focus on space-making is integral to her process. She has spent a decade creating community experiences around the world, and is looking to further collaborate on an international scale.",
